# Architecture

Identity Provider -> GameFlow -> Integrations

GameFlow does not depend on MembersFlow. It accepts an authenticated subject from an identity provider and never interprets that subject. MembersFlow is the first provider and speaks JWT. Later providers can be Google, Microsoft, GitHub, or a private OAuth server.

GameFlow owns profiles, shared XP, achievements, badges, rankings, challenges, and tournaments. Games and other modules integrate through one SDK contract. They submit facts. They do not write XP and they do not know which identity provider authenticated the player.
